sequenceDiagram
    participant S as OrderService<br/>(@Transactional)
    participant DB as Base de datos
    participant F as InvoiceListener<br/>@EventListener
    participant E as EmailListener<br/>@TransactionalEventListener
    participant P as LoyaltyPointsListener<br/>@Async + @TransactionalEventListener
    S->>DB: INSERT pedido
    S->>F: publishEvent(OrderPlaced)
    Note over F: mismo hilo,<br/>DENTRO de la transacción
    F-->>S: 
    S->>DB: COMMIT
    alt commit correcto
        DB-->>E: OrderPlaced (mismo hilo)
        DB--)P: OrderPlaced (otro hilo)
    else rollback
        Note over E,P: no reciben nada
    end
